# {{ .Vars.scratch_dir }}/ — the ungoverned annex

Nothing here is checked, named, linked, or reviewed. That is the point.

This directory exists so the other three stay clean. If there is nowhere to put a
messy thought, people put messy thoughts into the canonical documents — and then the
canonical documents stop being trustworthy. A governed system needs an ungoverned
annex, or the governance leaks.

Put here: half-formed designs, transcripts worth keeping for an hour, scratch
queries, an agent's working notes mid-task, the three approaches you rejected.

This directory is gitignored by default. If something in here turns out to matter,
promote it: move it into `../{{ .Vars.docs_dir }}/`, `../{{ .Vars.plans_dir }}/`, or
`../{{ .Vars.log_dir }}/` with a proper name and frontmatter.
